# Verbatim Map::GetHeight and Unit::UpdateAllowedPositionZ; cmangos 8ec338a1704e7dcb1c0213eb7ed58f9231ade40f
# Static replies are authored callbacks, NOT loaded terrain/VMap products or real-world geometry.
# Dynamic scripted replies isolate source operand order; empty runs actual source RegularGrid/G3D vertical empty-node traversal.
# Ground op fixes CanFly=false and CanSwim=false. Non-null unrelated atMap is ignored by source; explicit null controls also run.
# Finite callback observations are not public-provider admission claims. Source-only nonfinite rows are in a separate fixture.
# empty dynamic replies are -infinity, including in finite-domain rows; no nonfinite input is admitted by that fact.
# All *_bits are hexadecimal binary32; case, swim, counts and static_use_vmap are decimal.
# result_bits is Map height for map op; final input/output Z for ground op. Static-height validity is strict > -100000.
